        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "12 BALLARD ROAD, MILTOWN MALBAY, CO. CLARE V95 W7P4                                          \r\n\r\nMID TERRACED 3 BEDROOM PROPERTY WITH HOME OFFICE AT THE REAR AND CLOSE TO MILTOWN MALBAY TOWN CENTRE.\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\nAt Streets Ahead Properties, we are delighted to bring to the market this 3 bedroom, mid-terraced property located in a friendly and mature development. Constructed in 1970, this property offers spacious, bright and versatile living accommodation on two levels presented in meticulous order. The property has OFCH with a with an open fireplace. \r\n\r\nThis property is located a short distance from Miltown Malbay town centre and within close proximity to a variety of beaches and every amenity. Spanish Point beach and golf club is within a short drive, less than 10 minutes from the property. Other beaches, Dough More beach (Doonbeg), Seafield (Quilty), The White Strand and Lahinch are easily accessible, each less than a 20 minute drive.\r\n\r\nMiltown Malbay is a market town famous for its traditional music and the Willie Clancy Summer School which attracts thousands of musicians and followers to the town every year.  The town boasts many fine bars and restaurants, hardware/furniture store, bakery, clothes and shoe shop, bookshop, supermarket, post office, medical and pharmacy facilities, schools and a GAA pitch.\r\nThis property boasts a home office at the rear property with independent access.\r\nGated walkway entrance and boundary wall to front pathway of house with neat lawns.\r\n\r\nGROUND FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nEntrance porch, hallway, reception room/formal dining, kitchen, family dining room, main bathroom and hot-press.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nLanding, 3 spacious bedrooms and shower room. Attic access from landing.\r\n\r\nHOUSE\r\nBER F\r\nAPPROXIMATE FLOOR AREA 87.46 SQ METERS (941.41 SQ. FEET)\r\nYEAR CONSTRUCTED 1970\r\n\r\nHOME OFFICE\r\nBER G\r\nAPPROXIMATE FLOOR AREA 25.19 SQ. METERS (269 SQ. FEET)\r\nYEAR CONSTRUCTED 1970\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION – APPROXIMATE DIMENSIONS\r\n\r\nPorch: (2.10m x 1.05m) Tiled flooring, sliding full glass aluminium door. \r\n\r\nHallway: (3.83m x 1.27m) Carpeted flooring, stairwell to the first floor with ample under stairwell storage.\r\n\r\nReception room and formal dining: (3.97m x 3.82m) Carpeted flooring, complete with an open fireplace, marble mantle surround and base, pendant lighting and hotpress. This is an extremely spacious and bright room. Wall window to dining room. Front aspect.\r\n\r\nHotpress: (1.52m x 0.60m)\r\n\r\nKitchen: (2.41m x 1.63m) Open plan kitchen/dining complete with non slip linoleum flooring, fitted wall and base units, ample worktop space, electric cooker, 4 ring hob with extractor, tiled back splash, sink and washing machine. The oil burner is housed here.\r\n\r\nDining room: (2.74m x 2.38m) Open plan from kitchen, complete with non slip linoleum flooring, skylight that bringing in an abundance of  natural light. Rear aspect with door leading to yard and detached home office.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: (2.27m x 1.79m) Fully tiled and complete W.C.,W.H.B. with vanity incorporated underneath, bath and shower mixer, very spacious.\r\n\r\nStairwell: (2.31 x 0.87m) plus (0.87m x 0.52m) Carpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nLanding: (1.49m x 0.90m) plus (1.24m x 1.02m) Carpeted flooring, attic access.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: (2.85m x 2.34m) Rear aspect, alluminium single glazing, carpeted flooring and pendant lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: (3.33m x 3.16m) Rear aspect, carpeted flooring, fitted cream wardrobe incorporating vanity space and mirror, pendant lighting, aluminium single glazing.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: (3.55m x 2.78m)  Front aspect, double room, aluminium single glazing, fitted wardrobe incorporating vanity space and mirror, pendant lighting.\r\n\r\nShower Room: (2.38m x 1.80m) Front aspect, carpeted flooring, complete with an electric shower space, W.C., W.H.B. with vanity incorporated underneath, partial wall tiling and storage closet.\r\n\r\nHOME OFFICE\r\n\r\nDetached office situated at the rear of the property with independant rear access. \r\n\r\nKitchen/dining/ living: (4.35m x 3.08m) Complete with non slip Linoleum flooring, work top and sink, fitted base units, tiled splash back, fridge, no cooking facilities, boiler closet, 2 wall light points.\r\n\r\nStorage closet: (0.82m x 0.49m) \r\n\r\nOffice space (En-suite): (3.39m x 2.60m) Double room complete with non slip linoleum flooring and pendant lighting.\r\n\r\nEnsuite: (2.14m x 0.83m) Fully tiled and complete with an electric shower unit, W.C. and W.H.B.\r\n\r\nExternal\r\nOil tank to the rear\r\n\r\nPROPERTY FEATURES\r\n3 bedrooms.\r\nDetached home office at rear.\r\nClose to a variety of beautiful beaches, shops, bars, restaurants, Supervalue with post office, church, medical and GAA pitch.\r\nPresented in meticulous order.\r\nOil fired central heating and an open fireplace.\r\nFriendly, mature and peaceful development."
